      "titleHtml": "Đọc <ruby>文型<rp>(</rp><rt>ぶんけい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby> (văn mẫu)",
      "contentHtml": "</p> <p> <audio controls preload=\"none\"><source src=\"/Audio/minnamoi/bunkeireibun/100001101012.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\"></audio></p> <p> １．<div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai39_bk_1.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div><span><span _fck_bookmark=\"1\" style=\"display: none;\"> </span></span></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span>ニュースを <ruby>聞<rp>(</rp><rt>き</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いて、びっくりしました。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">Tôi ngạc nhiên khi nghe tin.</div></div></div></p> <p> ２．<div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai39_bk_2.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>地震<rp>(</rp><rt>じしん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>で ビルが <ruby>倒<rp>(</rp><rt>たお</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れました。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">T&ograve;a nhà đổ v&igrave; động đất.</div></div></div></p> <p> ３．<div class=\"playwrap\"><audio class=\"player\" src=\"/Audio/FD1/Minna_Bai39_bk_3.mp3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" preload=\"none\"></audio><a class=\"playerbt\" title=\"button\"></a></div></p> <p> <div class=\"tudich\"><div class=\"candich\"><span><ruby>体<rp>(</rp><rt>からだ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の <ruby>調子<rp>(</rp><rt>ちょうし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>が <ruby>悪<rp>(</rp><rt>わる</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いので、<ruby>病院<rp>(</rp><rt>びょういん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>へ <ruby>行<rp>(</rp><rt>い</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>きます。</span></div></span><div class=\"kqdich\"><span></span><div class=\"nddich\">V&igrave; thấy trong người không khỏe nên tôi đi bệnh viện.</div></div></div></p> <p> </div>",
